{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0865f28c-aa21-84b4-a23a-85c4d771aae6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-30T10:49:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Isabel Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:47:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:47:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, good morning. I am calling about noise. My neighbor, he run a generator all night. Every night."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:47:22-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, all night. Let me get some details so I can write this down properly. How long has that been going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:47:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since last Thursday. So, Thursday, Friday, Saturday, Sunday, Monday, and last night again. Six night now. I do not sleep good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:47:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Six nights. Okay. And where are you located? What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:47:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am at 233 Spring Street. The generator is next door, the house on the left side from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:47:48-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Two thirty-three Spring Street. Got it. And what time does it usually start up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:47:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Around nine, nine thirty at night. It stay on until morning, maybe six, seven. The sound is very loud, the bedroom window shake a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:48:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would wear on anybody. Is there any reason you know of that he'd need it, like a power problem on the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:48:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. Our power is fine. I have light, everything work. I think he just like to use it. I did not talk to him yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:48:17-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Go ahead, you had a question?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:48:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. What are the quiet hours? What time must the noise stop in Newport? I want to know before I call anybody else."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:48:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. So, generally the city does have quiet hours at night, overnight into the morning. I don't have the exact clock times in front of me, and I don't want to read you the wrong ones. Let me, um, give you the right place for that. Can you hold a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:48:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I can hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:48:46-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, thanks for waiting. The exact hours are in the noise rules, and the police non-emergency line is who responds to an active noise problem at night. For your complaint on file, I'll note the address, the generator, and the dates since Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:49:00-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Please write it. Because I am tired already. In the morning I must leave early, I wait for the drawbridge in Jamestown every day, maybe twenty minute. Then I am tired and late also."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:49:11-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, the bridge, that's a long start to the day. So you're getting up early and losing sleep at night. I'll put that the noise is overnight and ongoing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:49:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. That is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:49:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have your number as the one you're calling from. Is that okay for a callback?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:49:30-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, okay. It is 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:49:33-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight three. Perfect. Someone will follow up with you, and if it's going tonight, call the non-emergency line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:49:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you very much. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-30T10:49:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care, goodbye."
    }
  ],
